&lt;p style="margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;ⅰ国際エネルギー事業の強化&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 0px none #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 28.533333333333333333333333333px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 12px"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 0px none #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 300px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;span style="text-decoration: underline"&gt;ⅱ天然ガス発電所の建設&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 1.33px"&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 0px none #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 256px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・これまで進めてきたひびきＬＮＧ基地を活用した連携ビジネスを加速させ、アジア向けのＬＮＧ取扱量を増大。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 0px none #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 28.533333333333333333333333333px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size: 12px"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 0px none #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 300px; vertical-align: top; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・ひびき発電所の事業化を九州電力株式会社と共同で推進。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 18px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・同発電所の稼働を見据え、電力小売事業を強化。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 124.67px"&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 0px none #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 256px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
